WEBVTT

00:01:57.029 --> 00:02:00.908
is a 150-billion-dollar
industry, globally.

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:05.705
The International Labour
Organization's 2016 report

00:02:05.746 --> 00:02:12.086
reveals that 40.3 million people
were trafficked into modern-day slavery,

00:02:12.128 --> 00:02:16.757
out of which 23 million
were women and girls.

00:02:17.341 --> 00:02:22.013
It's as if girls and women
from poor families

00:02:22.054 --> 00:02:23.931
don't have any value,

00:02:23.931 --> 00:02:26.809
and their existence or their deaths ...

00:02:27.768 --> 00:02:28.936
don't matter.

00:02:29.437 --> 00:02:33.316
Their stories are mostly
unseen and unheard.